  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "FTP client for the DATASUS server (listing, downloads with cache, retries). It has a catalog of 112 DATASUS file types, to find, list and open tables by dataset, state and period. It can read a table straight from the server, without a download, with OpenStreamingReaderAsync (in preview). The changes in each version are in CHANGELOG.md: https://github.com/euclydesuchoas/dbsus/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md and questions and comments go to the Discussions: https://github.com/euclydesuchoas/dbsus/discussions",
